      "duration": 32.649,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "sentence_index": 0,
          "text": "So the next time you flip open a dictionary or scroll through a sorted list, remember: you're not just searching.",
          "start_time": 544.668,
          "end_time": 552.518,
          "duration": 7.85
        },
        {
          "sentence_index": 1,
          "text": "You're wielding one of the most powerful ideas in computation—an idea that turns millions into twenty, that transforms linear slogs into logarithmic leaps.",
          "start_time": 552.518,
          "end_time": 563.285,
          "duration": 10.767
        },
        {
          "sentence_index": 2,
          "text": "And that, in the end, is why binary search matters.",
          "start_time": 563.285,
          "end_time": 566.828,
          "duration": 3.543
        },
        {
          "sentence_index": 3,
          "text": "Not because it's fast—though it certainly is.",
          "start_time": 566.828,
          "end_time": 569.954,
